   191	Packet 002 already carries day 270, the six, Oryn's first post-thaw stop, Lira's two uncertain arms, Brom's bound/unread shoulder, the one-week ferry prediction, and Karis's unanswered case (`packets/MOVEMENT-002.md:18-20`). Its author must additionally inherit:
