   197	- **Brom:** the right shoulder remains in the older healer's four-yard drover's knot. Oryn declined to undo another healer's work and will inspect it beside her (`manuscript/chapter-06.md:139-143`). His hook was used on the ice rescue but remains with the crossbow kit (`manuscript/chapter-04.md:139-153`).
   198	- **Karis:** fifty-two sheets, map, two straightedges, kit, opened field ledger, one stored hair, and the eleven-line case remain under her control. She cannot read the four-sign index or know it is a grade; she has entered no causal theory (`manuscript/chapter-04.md:253-281`; `manuscript/chapter-05.md:145-195`; `manuscript/chapter-06.md:227-253`). After fix 14, *west* has now been spoken once at the day-268 table.
