   790	- **Grade and sheet:** three marks; first-tier box unused; four second-tier first-sheet ages 61/94/138/206; two-bar point past the fourth on the line; compass point and length figure remain unspoken; clean sheet pinned to the hide; pencil line from fourth circle through and a hand's breadth past the divider point (`chapter-45.md:53–177`; `chapter-46.md:319–335`).
