   794	- **Watcher pressure:** an unidentified rider kept a mile back on the 296th and a riderless horse stood in the western alders on the 297th; no sighting east of the river and no identity (`chapter-43.md:117–171,245`).
   795	- **Other live threads:** Cleon remains below with skin leaf, chronicle and board; Seln's case stays shut on his chest, contents unnamed; Vastin's debt and ignorance stand; Pike has thirteen lines and a dated season-space with no printed date; rope debt is paid; Oryn's road is her own and will diverge (`chapter-41.md:213`; `chapter-44.md:137–157,205–211`; `chapter-46.md:31–47,337–341`).
