   785	- **Inventory and order:** twelve fragments; deployment thirty-two; Seln ahead, tall spear, Teague with Cael at his left a stride back, Lira, young one, Karis plus both healers and mule in the middle, Brom, Vastin a stride behind, bow last (`chapter-44.md:281–291`; `chapter-46.md:337–341`).
