   137	Four hundred metres of quiet, over ground that went down toward the sink's bowl and then along the bowl's rim, with the shape at the middle getting a shape as they came. And then it had one, and he catalogued it from the rim, because he had wanted to stand in the middle of it since the autumn and was going to, and wanted the outside first.
