   153	*Three hundred and fourth day. The fourth site, the Sunken Span; the watch's fire. A hundred and twenty-three in hand; nothing owed; nothing earned. Nineteen. Thirteen. Twelve of us; the broad man on a leg that bears in three days; Teague's arm; Oryn a quarter of an hour on a slope. Nobody dead. Nobody declared.*
   154	
