    73	Cael entered it. He entered the finding, in her words, because they were exact. And under it he entered the thing that had not been done: that a line had been reached for by a man with forty years of reaching, and not drawn by a woman with one, and that the not-drawing was all that the year had been for, and that he had watched it hold at the hardest place it had yet been asked to, and it had held.
