    77	He could have. He had a thing on his own page that nobody at the fire had, from a spring, from a row of dates — a deep-layer sheet that said *six years* and was five years and a hundred-some days, and a day he knew to the hour that lay under the office's rounding like a stone under a river — and he could have laid it beside the two pages and made a third, and the third would have made the line shorter, and he did not, because it was his and it was a count and not a finding, and because a man who has just watched a discipline hold does not go behind it with his own key. He entered that he had not. That was three things not done at one fire, by three people, and he counted them, and let the count stand.
