   111	He could stand in this bay, as any carter might, and look back up the whole of that hill to the top of it.
   112	
   113	A girl with a box on her back had come up on his left side. She did not look at him, and she did not look anywhere else. She had kept her chin level down every yard of this road, coming in, without being asked, and it was level now.
