331:"It was forty steps yesterday, with a bolt in, and I counted them." He looked at the three of them, and then at the healer, who had opened her mouth and shut it again. "It's the only thing that we ever fetched for a paper and found, and I'd like to be the one that brings it up. I didn't do a great deal else down here."
