editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-52.md:237:Cael saw him look at that seal. It was a very short look, and it was a look of the kind that a man gives to a face in a crowd which he had not thought to meet. Then he read out what stood above it, in the voice that he kept for the reading of a form.
