editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-48.md:247:He opened the read, and gave it the stone.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-48.md:253:He told it no; and he shut the read, and lifted his head, and the black rock a foot from his face had gone to a grey smear.
