    99	It came. He had not expected to know when it came, and there was no mistaking it. Everything that he was, from a rib of rock to a slab of shale, stood in the one straight road, with every joint in its place; and the thing along him was no longer lying there. It was standing, as a prop stands when the weight has come onto it. It had both its ends.
