   181	She understood him now, sitting on a rock at the far end of the country with a lamp. Six people would walk east in the morning upon a ring that she had made in a sheet of paper with her thumbnail. A captain who could not read a hide would take his own after them, because she had said three days. An old man on a stick, who had once been the person sent to see that a filing stood, had read out two slips that afternoon and had looked at her, and waited to be told what she would enter.
