+## 7. Names
+
+No named person, animal or place outside the plan appears. The authorized existing names are Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln, Vastin, Oryn, Teague, Hesk, Cleon, Pike, Ternhall, Treswick, Denvash, Lowmarch, Millrace, the Fallow, the Stair, the Hall and the Sunken Span. Common nouns such as “the sink,” “the shelf,” “the step” and “the gap” are descriptive labels, not new proper names (`chapter-49.md:77–97`; `chapter-52.md:29–37`).
